        "description": "A Haraj member's public profile (id, username, handle, registration date, last seen, followers, membership, realtor and verified-identity flags, badges, up and down ratings) and their current ads with price, city, neighborhood, attributes, car and real-estate details, photos, dates and comment counts. Pass `next_page` back as `page`; null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/haraj-seller",
